#31001
NAME  grasshopper~
SHORT A green leaf-shaped grassoppher is here.~
LONG  This grasshopper is bright green, with wings that are shaped just like a small green leaf.  It's legs are cocked back and ready to jump at a moments notice.~
DESCR
The grasshopper is no longer than your thumb, its body the bright green of new
spring leaves.  Its folded wings mimic a single blade of grass so perfectly that
the insect all but vanishes the moment it goes still.  Every few seconds its
hind legs tense, coiled, ready to fling it out of reach in a heartbeat.
~
