#31003
NAME  bandit man~
SHORT A bandit stands here blocking the road.~
LONG  This bandit seems to be mostly human, but you can't really tell because of all of the clothing wrapped around him to keep the cold from biting.  Mostly in grays and blacks, it's no wonder you didn't notice him until you got here.~
DESCR
Layers of gray and black wool are wound around this man until little of him
shows but a strip of wary eyes.  What skin you can see is weathered and chapped
raw by the cold.  He keeps his weight balanced on the balls of his feet, one
hand never straying far from the blade at his hip.
~
