#31004
NAME  irritated snapping turtle~
SHORT An angry snapping turtle is here, upset that you disturbed its rest.~
LONG  This soft shell snapping turtle is quite large for such a small pond.  It's powerful neck seems dangerous given the sharp snapping tip on it's mouth.  It has strong forelegs and hindlegs and seems to have no interest in hiding in it's shell.~
DESCR
This soft-shelled snapper is far too big for the little pond that spawned it.
Its neck is thick and startlingly long, tipped with a hooked beak that could
take off a careless finger.  Powerful legs churn furrows in the mud, and it
makes no move to withdraw into its shell -- it would far rather bite.
~
