#31005
NAME  elia~
SHORT Elia is here writing in her journal.~
LONG  Elia sits here, a journal open across her knees, her pen moving in quick and eager strokes.~
DESCR
Elia is young, and it shows in the brightness of her eyes and the easy way she
smiles at nothing in particular.  Newly married, she wears her happiness plainly
and without apology.  Ink stains the side of one hand where it drags across the
page, and every so often she pauses to glance toward the door, as though waiting
on someone she is glad to wait for.
~
