#31006
NAME  chronomancer Midian~
SHORT Midian the chronomancer is here, investigating the paradox.~
LONG  Midian stands here in his chronomancers robes, still bearing the creases of being newly made.  His eyes are bright and curious, and despite being a bit tall, he carries himself with an air of affability.~
DESCR
Midian is tall and a little gangly, as though he has not quite grown into his
own height.  His chronomancer's robes are so new that the fold-creases still
hold their edges.  He crouches at the base of the tree, prodding at the empty
air itself with bright, curious eyes, muttering measurements to no one and
grinning whenever the numbers surprise him.
~
