#31007
NAME  midian~
SHORT A middle aged Midian is here searching frantically through papers.~
LONG  Midian seems to have aged quite a bit compared to his younger self, including odd scarring in various places.  His chronomancers  robes are worn and disheveled, showing an obvious lack of care.~
DESCR
The years sit heavily on Midian here.  Odd scars seam his hands and jaw, pale
and precise, like burns left by something that was never quite fire.  His robes
are stained and unmended, and he shuffles through drifts of loose paper with the
frantic, hollow-eyed focus of a man who has not slept properly in a very, very
long time.
~
