#31008
NAME  echo midian astral projection~
SHORT the astral echo of Midian~
LONG  A translucent projection of a young Midian stands here, gazing up at a sky only he can see.~
DESCR
This is Midian as he was at the very beginning -- young, bright-eyed, and utterly
absorbed.  He is not quite here; you can see the turning stars faintly through
him.  He murmurs figures and angles under his breath, laughing now and then at
some private discovery, and takes no notice of you at all.  He is only an echo --
a single moment of hope pressed permanently into this place.
~
