NAME  wisp star mote~
SHORT a drifting star-wisp~
LONG  A small wisp of cold star-fire drifts through the air, trailing sparks.~
DESCR
The wisp is a knot of pale, cold fire no bigger than a fist, drifting on unseen
currents of the air.  It is one of the observatory's old guardians, set long ago
to drive off anything that does not belong among the stars.  It pulses faintly,
and where it passes the air smells of frost and burnt lightning.
~
