#31010
NAME  sentinel sand glass construct~
SHORT A sand-glass sentinel is standing guard here.~
LONG  A towering sentinel of hardened sand and smoked glass stands watch here.~
DESCR
The sentinel is shaped from packed sand fused with plates of dark, smoked glass,
a head taller than any man and utterly without face.  Within its hollow trunk a
slow river of sand turns endlessly over, pouring up as often as down, and where
that sand shifts the whole figure seems to age and unage at once -- edges
crumbling, then healing bright again.  It does not breathe, does not blink, and
yet it plainly watches the engine at its back.
~
