#31011
NAME  moth instant caught frozen~
SHORT a moth held in a single instant of flight~
LONG  A pale moth hangs in the air, wings mid-beat, held in one unmoving instant.~
DESCR
The moth is small and dust-pale, and it is not resting -- it is stopped.  Its
wings are caught at the top of a beat, its legs curled for a landing it will
never make, a single mote of pollen frozen an inch beyond one antenna.  Whatever
Midian did to this room, the moth flew into it long ago and simply ceased to fall
through time along with the rest of the world.
~
