#31013
NAME  friend timekeeper toller~
SHORT Toller the timekeeper~
LONG  A haggard timekeeper looks up from his instruments, a watch in one hand, and studies you.~
DESCR
Toller is a chronomancer, a timekeeper of no small skill -- and, though the man
he hunts no longer knows it, Midian's oldest and dearest friend.  Thirty years
they were close; then Elia died, and Midian fled sideways into the hours
themselves, and it was Toller who took up the chase, era after era, always a step
behind.  The pursuit has worn him gaunt, but there is no madness in him, only a
tired and stubborn love.  A watch hangs at his neck, which he checks compulsively,
as though it could tell him how much of his friend is left to save.  He speaks to
you readily -- you, at least, will listen -- though it is plain that Midian himself
looks straight through him and sees only a stranger at his heels.
~
