#31014
NAME  automaton clockwork brass construct~
SHORT a brass clockwork automaton~
LONG  A brass clockwork automaton stalks the floor, gears whirring behind its ribs.~
DESCR
The automaton is built in a rough mockery of a man, its body a cage of brass
ribs through which you can see a heart of spinning gears.  It moves in sudden,
precise jerks, each step timed to the tick of the mechanism inside it, and its
blank faceplate turns to track you with the patience of a thing that never
tires.  Somewhere in its whirring chest, you are certain, a clock piece has
been locked away for safekeeping.
~
