#31015
NAME  golem escapement iron automaton construct~
SHORT an iron escapement-golem~
LONG  An iron escapement-golem lurches here, its chest a slowly ticking mechanism.~
DESCR
Taller and heavier than its brass kin, this golem is forged of blackened iron,
and where a heart would be a great escapement rocks back and forth, ticking out
each of its ponderous steps.  Chains and driving weights hang from its frame
like grim jewellery, swinging as it moves.  It guards the deeper chamber with
the dumb persistence of a machine that has forgotten it was ever given any
other order.
~
