#31016
NAME  fire elemental guardian flame~
SHORT a towering fire elemental~
LONG  A towering elemental of living fire uncoils above the great crucible, guarding it.~
DESCR
The elemental has no shape it keeps for long -- a pillar of white and orange
flame, now a coiling serpent of fire, now a vague and burning man.  Two points
of cold white light hang where its eyes should be, and they follow you with a
patient, furnace hunger.  It was bound here to keep Midian's forged keys from any
hand but his, and it has never once been relieved of the duty.  The heat coming
off it is enough to blister paint at ten paces.
~
