#31017
NAME  furnace tender construct automaton~
SHORT a furnace-tending construct~
LONG  A soot-blackened construct shuffles among the furnaces, tending fires that need no tending.~
DESCR
The construct is a thing of riveted iron plates and articulated brass, built in
a rough parody of a stooped labourer.  Its chest glows through the seams where
its own furnace-heart still burns, and its hands have been fitted with rakes and
tongs in place of fingers.  It performs its old tasks in an endless loop --
stoking, raking, stoking -- and turns on anything that interrupts the work with
the blind fury of a machine that has forgotten why it was made.
~
