#31018
NAME  flame scribe figure standing~
SHORT a scribe of standing flame~
LONG  A pale figure of standing flame drifts among the consoles, murmuring numbers to itself.~
DESCR
The figure is barely there -- a suggestion of a robed clerk sketched in low blue
fire, thin enough to read the consoles through.  It was Midian's assistant once,
or the echo of one, kept on past death to log the readings.  It does not seem to
see you; it drifts from gauge to gauge, reading each aloud in a soft crackling
voice, and where its numbers fall wrong it pauses, troubled, and begins the row
again.  Now and then it says a name -- Elia -- and cannot say why.
~
