NAME  arc wraith spark energy~
SHORT an arc-wraith~
LONG  An arc-wraith crawls along the dead relays, spitting blue sparks where it goes.~
DESCR
The wraith is a knot of naked current given something almost like a will, a
crawling snarl of blue-white light that climbs the copper and leaps the gaps
between the spark-terminals.  Where it lingers the metal blackens and the air
turns to ozone.  It was never meant to leave its cage; the paradox that broke
this place tore it loose, and now it hunts the charge in anything warm.
~
