NAME  relay golem construct automaton~
SHORT a relay-golem~
LONG  A relay-golem of stacked iron switches stands guard here, its contacts snapping open and shut.~
DESCR
The golem is a man-high tower of relay banks bolted to a single armature, built
by Midian to test his gates and never let a wrong answer pass.  Hundreds of iron
contacts open and close across its body in patterns that almost look like
thought.  Half of them are dead now, fused black, and the living half chatters
without rest -- a broken adding-machine that has forgotten every sum but the
order to strike.
~
