#31022
NAME  corin apprentice friend echo man~
SHORT Corin the apprentice~
LONG  Corin, or the echo left where Corin used to be, folds toward the floor mid-fall and never lands.~
DESCR
This was Midian's apprentice, a slight young man with ink-stained cuffs and a
scholar's stoop.  He is caught in the last half-second of dying: a wound opens
at his throat, his knees buckle, his mouth shapes a word -- and then the instant
snaps back to its beginning and plays again.  He falls, and falls, and falls,
and each time his eyes find yours with the same startled grief, as though he has
only just realised he is not permitted to finish.  Whatever killed him here is
long gone.  Only the killing remains, worn smooth by endless repetition.
~
