#31024
NAME  warden mirror reflection light~
SHORT a warden of the mirror~
LONG  A tall smear of cold light stands in the room, wearing your own reflection like a borrowed coat.~
DESCR
There is no body here, only a standing sheet of reflection torn free of any
mirror.  It shows you back to yourself -- your face, your stance, the weapon in
your hand -- but always a half-second late, so that when you move it lunges to
catch up, and the catching-up is a blow.  Where its edges fray, the air behind
it repeats in narrow bands, the same sliver of room stacked a hundred times deep.
It hates being looked away from, and it strikes hardest at those who try.
~
