#31025
NAME  echo midian seated figure~
SHORT a fraying echo of Midian~
LONG  A fraying echo of Midian sits in the chair, watching futures no longer shown.~
DESCR
It is not the man himself but the shape he wore out of this place -- a figure
of thin grey light held in the exact posture of long watching, elbows on
knees, gaze fixed forward on the dead screens.  Where it meets the dissolving
air its edges lift and drift away like ash off a cold fire.  It does not turn
to you.  Whatever it is still watching, it is plainly not here, and not now.
~
