#31026
NAME  sentinel fixed time construct~
SHORT a sentinel of fixed time~
LONG  A sentinel of fixed time stands guard where the futures turn beneath the glass.~
DESCR
Midian built it to defend the one outcome he chose against every other that
might undo it.  It is a tall thing of frayed silver plate and slow brass
gearwork, and where its body should end it thins instead into the grey nothing
of the chamber, half-erased and still functioning.  Its single lens-eye tracks
you with the flat patience of something that has already watched how this ends,
and found you wanting in it.
~
