#31028
NAME  toller timekeeper friend~
SHORT Toller the timekeeper~
LONG  Toller stands here, soot-streaked and gaunt, watching the man who does not know him.~
DESCR
The chase has worn Toller down to wire and shadow, and the fire of this era has
scorched his timekeeper's coat and blistered his hands -- but his eyes are the
same stubborn, patient brown they always were.  He has followed his oldest friend
even into the flame, close enough now to watch him work.  Midian, wrapped in his
madness, glances through Toller as though he were a stranger, and never once sees
the boy he grew up beside.  The watch at his throat he checks still, as if to
count how much of Midian is left to reach before the fire takes the rest.
~
