EDESC chart star-chart notes astral~
The chart is beautiful and obsessive, every star numbered, every margin crammed
with a young man's certainty.  "Time is not a river," one note insists, "but a
thing you can outpace -- I have watched the heavens slow when I run the gallery,
I swear it."  Traced over the constellations in fresh ink is a single winding
path, climbing from the base of the sky to its summit: the true way up the Axis,
if you can match it to the rooms.  In one corner, softer: "E. asks why I never
sleep.  How can I sleep, with this so close?"~
End

