EDESC letter folded friend first~
The hand is not Midian's -- rounder, hurried, warm.

  "Midian -- I have read your pages three times and still I cannot hold the
  shape of it in my head.  You say you moved the coin, not through the room, but
  through the hour -- that it sat on your table yesterday and today both, and you
  chose which.  I believe you because it is you, and for no better reason.  Send
  me the smaller proofs first.  I am not ready for the large ones, and I do not
  think you are either.  -- your friend"~
End

#31018
