#31006
NAME   The small cavern~
DESCR
This corner of the cavern is close and low, the ceiling studded with stubby
formations that drip steadily onto the stone below.  Centuries of that slow
patience have built pale humps of rock underfoot.  The dripping is constant here,
almost a heartbeat, echoing off unseen walls.
~
