#31007
NAME   The small cavern~
DESCR
The cavern narrows here into an alcove of smooth, water-worn stone.  A shallow
pool has gathered in a dip in the floor, black and perfectly still, reflecting
nothing at all.  The walls glisten faintly where trapped minerals catch the
edge of your vision, then vanish when you look at them directly.
~
