#31008
NAME   The small cavern~
DESCR
The floor of the cavern rises here in a broad shelf of tumbled rock.  Fallen
slabs lean against one another overhead, propped in a balance you would rather
not test.  The passages that lead away from this spot branch in every direction,
as though the mountain could never quite decide which way to let the water run.
~
