#31009
NAME   The small cavern~
DESCR
Here the cavern pinches inward, forcing you between two great fins of stone.  The
rock is cold enough to ache against your palm.  Beyond the gap the ceiling opens
out again, but the way through is tight, and the darkness past it gives no hint
of what waits on the other side.
~
