#31013
NAME   The Edge Of The Collapsed Landslide~
DESCR
The landslide's western arm ends here against a shoulder of the mountain.  The
way east follows a thin animal trail; to the south, half-buried in the tumbled
scree, a great pile of loose rocks has slid down to cover what might once have
been a passage.  A draught of cold, still air leaks faintly from somewhere behind
them.
~
