#31014
NAME   A small animal trail on the mountain~
DESCR
A thread of a trail winds along the mountainside here, worn into the slope by
generations of deer and goat.  It is barely a boot wide, and the drop to your
left falls away into scrub and scree.  Wind combs steadily across the open rock,
carrying the thin, cold smell of snow from the peaks above.
~
