#31017
NAME   A small animal trail on the mountain~
DESCR
Here the trail levels out across a broad shelf of rock, an easier stretch after
the climb.  Old droppings and a few tufts of snagged fur show that the animals
still use this path.  A lone, wind-bent pine stands sentinel at the shelf's edge,
its needles whispering in the constant breeze.
~
