#31018
NAME   A small animal trail on the mountain~
DESCR
The trail begins its long descent here, dropping down off the bare mountain rock
toward the greener slopes below.  Loose gravel skitters out from under each step
and bounds away down the incline.  Below and to the east you can make out where
the open stone gives way to grass and the first scattered trees.
~
