#31019
NAME   A small animal trail on the hillside~
DESCR
The bare mountain is behind you now, and the trail runs across a grassy hillside
soft with turf.  Wildflowers nod in the wind, and the buzz of insects replaces
the empty silence of the heights.  The path is easier here, worn broad and
comfortable where the animals have lingered to graze.
~
