#31021
NAME   A small animal trail on the hillside~
DESCR
The trail crosses the flank of the hill here, following the contour of the land.
Below, the grass thickens and darkens toward a distant treeline; above, it thins
back toward the naked rock of the mountain.  The wind is gentler down here, and
warm enough now to smell the green of growing things.
~
