#31024
NAME   Edge of a Grassy Field~
DESCR
This field is full of short grasses and small wildflowers.  The air is crisp and
clear, but a bit chilly because of the elevation.  The sky is dominated
by the mountains to the north, even as close as you are to them.  Not too far to
the west, you can see the forest ends at the base of the mountainside.  You can
also see some recent landslides from this distance.
~
