#31036
NAME   Bedroom of a Hermits House~
DESCR
A small, spare bedroom, barely wide enough for the narrow bed pushed against the
far wall.  The blankets are neatly made, though a soft grey fur of dust has
settled over everything.  A single wooden chair waits beside the bed, and a
shuttered window lets in thin blades of pale light.  Two people clearly once
shared a quiet life within these walls.
~
