#31037
NAME   Behind a Hermits House~
DESCR
The cottage backs onto a scrap of tended yard long gone wild, hemmed in by the
dark edge of the forest.  A rickety lean-to sags against the rear wall, and the
remains of a vegetable garden have bolted and gone to seed.  In the centre of
the yard stands the round stone lip of an old well, its bucket rope frayed to
threads and its depths lost in shadow.
~
