As you pass through the thick branches that seem to be overgrown, you are able
to still follow the thin animnal trail as it continues along the ancient
roadbase.  Occasionally you spot an errant cobblestone or moss covered road
marker.  The trees are ancient, like the mountain that you spot peeking between
the branches occasionally as you look towards the sky.  Light filters down
through the branches making this forest light up with a verdant glow.
~
