The cavern comes to a dead stop here against a wall of that same unnaturally
smooth stone.  For all that it looks like a dead end, the air moves -- a slow
draft slides out from somewhere along the seams, cool and faintly stale.  There
is a way onward from here, though the mountain has done its patient best to hide
where it begins.
~
