#31051
NAME   The Waiting Room~
DESCR
Beyond the great door lies a small, perfectly round chamber of the same seamless
metal.  There is nothing here -- no furniture, no marking -- save a smooth archway
to the north and the sealed disc behind you to the south.  The air is warm and
utterly still, and carries the sense of a held breath.  Something about the place
suggests it is not a destination but a threshold, and that what lies north may
not be the same twice.~
