#31052
NAME   The End of Time~
DESCR
Time seems to speed up as you move, accelerating until there is a blur of white
streaming past you faster than you can comprehend.  Suddenly everything stops,
and there is only black.  There is nothing here.  You are not exactly floating --
it is simply that there is nothing left to float in, nothing to mark motion or
stillness, no up, no down, no now.  There is just... nothing.  And somewhere out
in that nothing, patient and unhurried, something is waiting for you.~
