#31070
NAME   The Hourglass Sanctum~
DESCR
A calm, ordered chamber opens around you, its walls lined with hourglasses of
every size -- from thimble-small to taller than a man -- each one turned and
running, their sand whispering down in a hundred soft streams.  The floor is
swept clean, the brass fittings polished, everything kept with the plain pride of
a man still sure of his work.  A doorway north leads deeper into the wing, where
Midian first learned to move not himself but objects through their years.  To the
south a sealed arch waits, its threshold dark and cold.
~
