#31072
NAME   Primal Sanctum~
DESCR
The sanctum stands as a threshold between the quiet outer lab and something far
hungrier to the north.  Here the instruments are older and cruder -- great copper
vessels, banks of bellows gone to verdigris, iron cradles built to hold fire the
way a lamp holds a flame.  Elia's silver box grows faintly warm against you, as
though it remembers heat.  Through the northern doorway the air ripples and
glows, and a dry furnace-wind breathes out to meet you.  To the south the floor
gives onto bare, unfinished stone.
~
