#31074
NAME   Paradox Sanctum~
DESCR
A round chamber of black glass, and everything in it happens twice.  Your
footfall on the threshold arrives, pauses, and arrives again a breath later, an
echo that comes from ahead of you instead of behind.  The walls are hung with
clocks that all read the same instant and refuse to leave it.  Cold air pours
down from the north, where a passage opens onto a corridor that seems, from
here, to be several corridors laid one atop another.  To the south a sealed arch
waits, dark and disused, its way not yet opened.
~
