#31076
NAME   The Celestial Axis - First Rung~
DESCR
The steps open onto a great central shaft that rises through the very heart of
this place, its walls set with rings of slowly turning brass.  Directly overhead
hangs the moon -- here only a thin new crescent, barely a nail-paring of light.
Passages branch away east and west into the lower firmament, but the true way is
upward, if you can read which turning the sky will allow.
~
