#31079
NAME   The Wandering Stars~
DESCR
Here the fixed stars give way to the wanderers -- the planets, five bright points
that keep no honest place in the sky.  The chamber seems to turn slowly around you,
and the moon overhead is dark and new, offering no light and no guidance at all.
It would be an easy thing to lose the true way entirely among these rooms.
~
