DESCR
Near the top of the shaft now, you can see the whole mechanism of the place --
concentric brass orbits nested one inside another, each carrying its painted world
in a slow, endless circle.  The moon above has grown to a fat gibbous curve,
flooding the shaft with pale light.  The upper firmament branches away to either
side; the way up is very close.
