#31096
NAME   The Control Gallery~
DESCR
The consoles here are given over to a single great mechanism: a jointed armature
of silver and brass, folded against the north wall and clearly built to reach out
and forward, through the glass beyond, into the chamber sealed on the far side.
Whatever it was made to grasp, it grasps nothing now -- its fingers curled and
still, waiting on a hand at the controls.
~
