#31097
NAME   The Control Gallery~
DESCR
This part of the gallery looks out over the whole central shaft, the moon-tracking
rings turning far below.  A brass speaking-tube and a bank of long levers suggest
this is where the most delicate work was directed.  A window set into the north
wall gives onto darkness -- and, faintly, the gleam of something kept safe beyond
the glass.
~
