More instruments crowd this length of the gallery -- a long table of nested
rings, a rack of graduated rods, an orrery-drum wound with fine bright chain.
Chalk diagrams of the moon's phases march across a slate board on the wall, half
erased and rewritten.  Everything here is meticulous, hopeful, and long, long
abandoned.
~
