EDESC pedestal glass dome mote starlight~
Beneath the glass, the mote of fixed starlight hangs at the centre of the
pedestal, no larger than a seed and brighter than a lamp.  It does not fall.  It
does not drift.  It simply holds, exactly where it was set, while everything else
in the world grows older around it.  The armatures overhead are angled to lift the
dome and take it -- but the controls for that are back in the gallery, on the far
side of the glass.~
End

