#31110
NAME   The Hall of Falling Sand~
DESCR
A long hall runs north, its high ceiling lost in shadow, both side walls fitted
with shelves of running hourglasses.  The sound of falling sand is everywhere --
a dry, endless hush, like rain that never quite lands.  Everything here is
orderly and whole: no dust, no ruin, only the patient upkeep of a careful mind.
Smaller chambers open to the east and west, and the hall continues north.
~
