#31114
NAME   The Weathering Room~
DESCR
A workroom built around a strange cradle of glass and brass -- an apparatus for
aging and unaging small objects, its twin funnels of sand poised to pour years
into or out of whatever is set between them.  Test pieces line a shelf: an iron
nail rusted to lace, a green twig, an apple whole and rotten at once.  A ledger
lies open on the bench in Midian's careful hand.  The door is west.
~
