EDESC apparatus cradle funnels~
Set an object in the cradle, Midian's notes explain, and turn the funnels: sand
pours down to age it, or pours up to give its years back.  The mechanism is
delicate and beautifully kept, every joint oiled, every glass clean.~
End

#31121
NAME   The Reversed Garden~
DESCR
A curious indoor garden, its beds filled not with soil but with fine white sand.
From the sand rise plants caught mid-change -- a sapling shrinking back toward its
seed, a flower folding into bud, a staff of dark wood softening again into a green
sprout.  The air is warm and still and smells of turned earth.  A second letter
rests on a low stone bench, weighted with a small pebble.  The way out lies east.
~
