#31122
NAME   The Sundial Court~
DESCR
A round court lit by a pale false sun that tracks slowly across a painted sky.
At its centre a great sundial throws a knife of shadow that creeps visibly as you
watch, far faster than any true day.  Here Midian calibrated his instruments
against the turning of the heavens, coaxing them to agree.  A passage leads north
into a hush of glass cases, and the way back lies west.
~
