#31124
NAME   The Reliquary of Hours~
DESCR
A hushed reliquary where Midian kept his failures and his firsts alike, each
sealed in its own case of clean glass: a rose that will not wilt, a candle that
burns without shortening, a dead bird returned to the shape of the egg.  Small
labels in his hand record the day each was lifted out of time's reach.  A single
passage leads south.
~
