End

#31115
NAME   The De-Aging Engine~
DESCR
The source of the humming stands here: a broad, low engine of glass drums and
sand-filled coils, the beating heart of Midian's craft for turning an object back
against its own years.  A cradle at its centre holds a single key of bright,
unblemished silver, gleaming as though freshly struck.  Beside it lies its
discarded twin -- the same key before its ruin was undone, brown and crumbling to
lace.  A sentinel guards the engine.  A passage leads north; the way back is south.
~
