#31119
NAME   The Control Gallery - East Terminus~
DESCR
The eastern end of the console gallery, its ledgers stacked and squared, its
instruments dark and waiting.  A second door of pale silver is set into the north
wall, its keyhole the exact match of the first -- the far side, surely, of
whatever lies sealed beyond.  The gallery runs west toward the master controls.
~
