#31117
NAME   The Experiment Chamber - Antechamber~
DESCR
Beyond the vault door the air turns cold and utterly silent -- not a single grain
of sand moves here.  This is the experiment chamber proper, where Midian tested
his craft on objects he dared not risk out in the open wing.  Shrouded shapes
stand under dust-cloths, and a low table bears the tools of precise, patient work.
A way leads east, deeper in; the vault door lies south behind you.
~
