#31123
NAME   The Experiment Chamber - The Reversing Loom~
DESCR
A narrow inner room dominated by a device like a loom strung not with thread but
with thin ribbons of falling sand, each stream running upward as often as down.
Half-finished trials hang in its frame, objects held between one age and another,
neither growing nor decaying while the loom keeps them.  Ways lead east and west.
~
