#31131
NAME   The Control Gallery~
DESCR
This is the heart of the workshop, a gallery of instrument consoles ranked
around a central floor.  Escapement wheels turn behind glass, governors spin
lazily on their spindles, and a great master pendulum sweeps overhead, ticking
out the beat that all the lesser machines struggle to match.  Chalkboards crowd
the walls, covered edge to edge with equations that circle back on themselves.
An alcove opens to the east, and a colder passage runs north toward the sealed
experiment chamber.
~
