#31132
NAME   Toller's Vigil~
DESCR
A cramped alcove has been made into a traveller's camp, more lived-in than the
rest of the workshop.  A cot, a cold kettle, and a folding desk of timekeeper's
instruments speak of someone who has kept watch here a long while.  Charts of
Midian's leaps through the hours are pinned above the desk, marked and dated in a
different, steadier hand -- the patient work of a man tracking a friend across the
years, always arriving just after he has gone.
~
