#31133
NAME   The Chamber Approach~
DESCR
The rooms narrow here into a cold stone landing before the experiment chamber.
The cheerful clutter of the workshop gives way to something more deliberate: the
walls are lined with lead, and a heavy geared door stands to the west, its face
worked into the shape of a clock with no hands.  A second door to the east hangs
ajar, the way out once the work within is done.  The ticking is quieter here, as
if the room is holding its breath.
~
