#31134
NAME   The Experiment Chamber - West Bay~
DESCR
You step into the experiment chamber, a broad vaulted hall built around a single
purpose.  Pendulums of every size hang from the ceiling, some frozen mid-swing in
a way that makes your stomach turn, others sweeping far too slow or far too fast
for their length.  Midian has been altering the flow of time in this very air,
and the proof of it hangs all around you, stopped and started at his whim.  The
chamber curves away to the north.
~
