The chamber floor is given over to workbenches here, each one a graveyard of
half-finished mechanisms.  Escapement wheels lie in trays sorted by size, and a
row of governors spin at speeds that do not match the effort turning them.  A
construct has clearly been assembled and dismantled on this bench a dozen times.
The hall continues east and drops back south toward the entrance.
