NAME   The Experiment Chamber - Crossing~
DESCR
A wide crossing where three ways meet beneath a canopy of hanging weights, each
one strung on a chain long enough to graze the floor.  To the north a low geared
door is set into the wall, its keyhole cut in the unmistakable shape of a gear
tooth.  The rest of the chamber opens west and east, and the slow tick of the
master mechanism reaches even here.
