The chamber turns here past a bank of tall regulator cases, their pendulums
swinging behind cracked glass.  One case has been shattered outright, its works
spilled across the floor in a slick of oil and broken jewels.  A narrow doorway
to the east leads into what looks like a scrap room; the chamber proper runs on
to the south and west.
