DESCR
This eastern bay of the chamber has been swept almost clean, the benches pushed
back against the walls to make room for a single great frame of brass, empty now,
as though it once held a machine that has since been carried away.  Faint scorch
marks fan across the floor beneath it.  A doorway leads north back into the
chamber, and the exit hall lies to the west.
