#31139
NAME   The Chamber Exit Hall~
DESCR
A short hall of lead-lined stone, plainly the way out of the experiment chamber.
The door at its western end stands closed but unlocked, opening back toward the
workshop and the long road out.  Someone has scratched a single line into the
wall beside it, over and over, as if counting days: how many, you cannot tell.
~
