#31141
NAME   The Weight Well~
DESCR
The floor drops away here into a deep well, and down its throat hang the driving
weights of some enormous clock, chains vanishing into the dark below.  A railed
walkway crosses the gap.  On the far side a heavy door is set with a keyhole
shaped like a slotted weight, and the whole room hums faintly with the tension of
all that iron waiting to fall.
~
