#31142
NAME   The Assembly Bench~
DESCR
This is where the work comes together.  A long assembly bench dominates the room,
and upon it, at last, stands a clock built whole from the scattered pieces of the
workshop: pendulum, gear, escapement, and weight married into one ticking
machine.  Beyond it a final door stands sealed, its keyhole no ordinary slot but
the exact silhouette of the finished clock itself.  Only the assembled work will
open it.
~
