#31143
NAME   The Escapement Heart Vault~
DESCR
A small round vault, quiet as a tomb after the endless ticking of the workshop.
In its center, cradled on a stand of black velvet, rests a single exquisite
component -- an escapement heart, machined finer than anything else in these
rooms.  This is what all the rest was built to protect: a piece of Midian's final
work, shaped and sized to be set into a small silver box.  The air around it is
utterly still, as though time itself has been told to wait.
~
