#31145
NAME   The Automaton Scrapyard~
DESCR
A cramped side room heaped with the ruined bodies of clockwork automatons, arms
and gears and dented brass skulls tangled together in the corners.  Some still
twitch, a wheel turning here, a jaw clicking there, animated by mechanisms that
have not yet wound down.  Whatever Midian and his patient guest have been
building, they have paid for it in a great many broken servants.
~
