#31150
NAME   The Ashen Threshold~
DESCR
You cross into the first of Midian's fire-halls, and the temperature climbs at
once.  Soot lies thick on every surface, and the walls are streaked black where
old flames licked too high.  Buckled sheets of metal, once panelling, hang half
peeled from the stone.  A fine grey ash drifts down from somewhere above and
settles on your shoulders like snow that has forgotten how to be cold.  The
sanctum lies behind you to the south; the hall runs on, hotter, to the north,
and a soot-black stair climbs away above.
~
