#31151
NAME   The Cinderway Corridor~
DESCR
The corridor is paved with dull cinders that crunch and glow faintly underfoot,
never quite going out.  Elemental conduits run along the ceiling, thick glass
pipes that should carry captured fire but now stand cracked and dark.  Heat
radiates from a doorway to the east, where a deeper red light pulses.  The way
north climbs toward a stutter of broken light, and the corridor falls back
southward toward the threshold.
~
