#31152
NAME   The Stutter Room~
DESCR
Something is wrong with time in this room, and you feel it in your teeth.  A
loose panel by the wall falls, strikes the floor, and leaps back to its place,
over and over, caught in a groove three seconds long.  A guttering flame on a
wall-sconce burns down, gutters out, and stands whole again.  This is the first
room where Midian's meddling tore the weave of other hours -- and you are
watching an old wound refuse to close.  Passages lead south and north.
~
