#31154
NAME   The Great Crucible~
DESCR
This is the beating heart of the fire-wing: a single vast crucible sunk into the
floor, wide as a millpond and brimming with molten light.  The air above it
shivers, and the walls are glazed to glass by centuries of heat.  This is where
Midian forged the tools of his ambition -- and, the scorch-marks suggest, where
more than one of them turned on him.  Something vast and burning uncoils above
the crucible's surface, watching you with eyes like white coals.  The only way
out is back to the west.
~
