#31155
NAME   The Elemental Conduit Junction~
DESCR
Four thick conduits of fire-glass meet here in a rusted iron collar, splitting
the wing's stolen heat toward its many engines.  Two of the pipes still glow a
sullen orange; the others are dark and frost-rimed, drawing cold instead of fire.
Valves and stopcocks crust the junction, most seized solid.  Ways open south,
north, and east, each breathing a different temperature at you.
~
