#31156
NAME   The Control Gallery~
DESCR
A long gallery of instrument consoles curves along one wall, their faces a ruin
of cracked gauges, melted dials, and blistered brass.  This is where Midian read
the temperature of the ages and fed his fires accordingly.  Half the readouts
still twitch, needles swinging between impossible extremes.  A pale figure of
standing flame drifts among the consoles, murmuring numbers to itself in a voice
like settling coals.  Ways lead south, north, and east.
~
