#31157
NAME   The Heat-sink Vault~
DESCR
The heat drains out of you the moment you enter.  This vault was built to bleed
off the wing's excess fire, and something in its balance has broken: here the air
runs backward and cold, and your breath hangs in a fog that drifts the wrong way,
toward your mouth.  Frost feathers climb the walls in patterns that undraw
themselves if you watch too long.  A bank of heat-sink rods stands racked against
the far wall.  The junction lies back to the west.
~
