#31158
NAME   The Chamber Approach~
DESCR
The gallery ends at a scorched antechamber, and the way forward is barred.  A
heavy blast door of dull metal fills the eastern wall, its surface scarred by
fire from the far side, a single keyhole set at its heart like a closed eye.
Warning-glyphs, half melted, ring the frame.  Whatever Midian kept beyond this
door, he meant to keep it from himself as much as from anyone.  The gallery lies
back to the south.
~
