#31160
NAME   The Timewell~
DESCR
At the centre of the chamber a well of white fire sinks into the floor, and the
air above it does not behave.  A dropped cinder falls upward.  Sparks trace their
own paths in reverse, gathering back into the flame.  Here, hottest of all,
Midian bent time and heat together, and here the damage runs deepest -- you can
feel a second, wrong "now" pressing against your own.  Ways open west, east, and
north, each shimmering with risen heat.
~
