#31161
NAME   The Inner Hearth~
DESCR
This innermost cell was Midian's private hearth, and it is oddly still.  A low
stone pedestal stands at its centre, ringed by cold braziers, and upon the
pedestal rests a single point of light that draws the eye and will not let it go.
The walls here are unmarked by soot, as though the fire in this room learned long
ago to burn without smoke -- or without warmth.  A vent-door of slatted metal
leads east; the timewell lies back to the west.
~
