#31162
NAME   The Cooling Vent~
DESCR
You step out into a long venting-shaft where the wing exhales its spent heat.
The air moves at last, a dry wind sighing away down the passage, and after the
inner hearth it feels almost cool.  Grilles in the floor glow faintly far below.
The vent-door lies back to the west; a soot-black stair descends to the south.
~
