NAME   The Ashfall Return Stair~
DESCR
A narrow stair spirals down through drifting ash, closing the loop back toward
the threshold.  Grey flakes settle endlessly out of the dark above, deep enough
here to muffle your steps.  The vent-shaft lies back to the north, and below, a
faint familiar light marks the ashen threshold where you began.  The stair
descends.
~
