#31164
NAME   The Instrument Annex~
DESCR
A side annex crammed with redundant instruments branches off the gallery.  Rolls
of scorched schematics lie heaped in the corners, and a wall of secondary gauges
records temperatures no living thing could survive.  A single console here still
holds power, its cracked plate flickering with the last of a message its maker
never finished.  The gallery lies back to the west.
~
