#31165
NAME   The Flicker Alcove~
DESCR
A cramped alcove opens off the timewell, and within it a single instant repeats
without end.  A gout of flame erupts from a ruptured conduit, freezes at its
fullest reach, and is gone -- then erupts again, identical, tireless.  You could
count your heartbeats by it.  Whoever stood here to observe the effect left a
handprint scorched into the wall, fingers spread, as if to push the moment away.
The timewell lies back to the south.
~
