#31184
NAME   The Charged Cistern~
DESCR
This low bay was meant to hold Midian's spare cells, but a broken conduit has
flooded it ankle-deep with black water, and the water is not safe.  A dropped
cable trails into it and the whole surface crawls with a thin, restless skin of
current, hissing and spitting where it laps the walls.  Dead capacitors bob in
the shallows like drowned lanterns.  There is nothing to gain here but a jolt;
the only way out is back west.
~
