#31172
NAME   The AND-Gate Station~
DESCR
This narrow cell is the AND gate laid bare: two heavy feed-levers on the south
wall and, above them, a single lamp that Midian built to light only when both
levers are thrown together.  The lamp is dark now, its glass starred with a
crack, and one lever hangs snapped from its slot.  Burn-marks fan across the iron
where the logic once ran hot.  A service-hatch leads north, deeper into the
gate-works.
~
