#31174
NAME   The OR-Gate Station~
DESCR
The OR gate is a wider, calmer room, its logic gentler: a lamp above two levers
that Midian set to light if either one is thrown.  Of the three gate-stations it
is the least ruined, and its lamp still gives a weak, guttering glow, enough to
throw long shadows.  Cable-runs branch away in two directions -- north, into a
vault of stacked relays, and west, toward the low, sour hum of the inverter.
~
