#31175
NAME   The Relay Bank Vault~
DESCR
Wall upon wall of relays fill this deep vault, tens of thousands of iron switches
stacked in perfect, patient ranks -- Midian's memory, his adder, his pride, all
of it dark and still now.  A charged capacitor cell rests in a copper cradle near
the door, one of the last still holding its current; beside it, in a dead relay's
open jaw, lies a cold bit-token stamped with a ring.  The ranks stretch away into
silence.  There is no exit but the way you came, south.
~
