#31182
NAME   The NOT-Gate Station~
DESCR
The inverter cell is a mean, cramped space that stinks of hot iron and failure.
The NOT gate is simplest of all -- one feed in, its opposite out -- and Midian
built a relay-golem here to test it, over and over, forever.  The golem still
runs, though the test broke long ago; its contacts chatter and snap in the dark,
flipping ones to zeros and back at nothing.  A grated stair drops south into a
sump where the dead cells were dumped.
~
