#31183
NAME   The Dead Relay Sump~
DESCR
At the bottom of the grated stair is the sump, a pit where every burned-out cell
and fused relay of the engine was thrown to rot.  They lie in drifts, blackened
and split, leaking a faint corrosive sludge that eats the light.  Here and there
a dying capacitor still finds the strength for one last spark, a small blue
flinch in the dark.  It is a graveyard for Midian's precision, and it holds
nothing living.  The stair leads back north.
~
