#31179
NAME   The Galvanic Experiment Chamber~
DESCR
This is the heart of it: a vaulted chamber where Midian first caught a moment of
raw power and made it hold still.  It is the most broken room in the wing -- the
walls are black with old fire, cables hang torn and spitting, and great arcs of
loose lightning crawl the ironwork and crack against the floor without pause.  At
the centre, on a slender pedestal beneath a torn glass hood, hangs a single bolt
of lightning frozen mid-strike, silent and white-hot.  A doorway west is the way
in; another east is the marked way out; and a low arch leads north to an
instrument annex.
~
