0 0 31179
EDESC body toller corpse timekeeper~
Toller lies where he fell, slumped over his own workbench, and there is no doubt
that he is dead.  The charge he built ran through him and out again, and it has
left him whole but utterly still, one burned hand still closed around a half-made
cell.  He gave himself to the work knowingly -- an outside hand, a life freely
paid, to make possible the one cut Midian could never make from within.  His last
notes lie scattered under his open fingers.~
End

