#31190
NAME   Threshold of the Broken Hour~
DESCR
The corridor beyond the sanctum cannot decide how long it is.  You take a step
and the far wall is nearer; you take another and it has drawn back again, so
that walking here feels like wading against a tide made of distance.  Faint
scorch-marks fan across the ceiling, the record of some experiment that got
loose.  The air tastes of hot brass and stopped time.  The way runs on to the
north; the sanctum lies south.
~
