#31191
NAME   The Mirror Hall~
DESCR
A long panelled hall lined floor to ceiling with mirrors, and every mirror is
empty.  They hold the hall, the cold lamplight, the dust -- but not you, never
you, as though you have not yet been permitted to happen here.  The hall runs
straight north and back south, and there is something wrong with how ordinary
it looks, some detail your eye keeps sliding off.  You are almost certain you
have not been here before.
~
