#31197
NAME   The Gallery's Reflection~
DESCR
This narrow room should not exist.  It is the west end of the gallery again --
the same consoles, the same trembling dials -- but reflected, every letter on
every ledger reversed, and it dead-ends where the true gallery would carry on.
It is the room the dead mirror was showing, and you have walked into the glass.
The only way out is back east, into the world that reads the right way round.
~
