NAME   The Sealed Threshold~
DESCR
A short, cold antechamber at the mouth of the experiment chamber.  The chamber
itself lies behind a great blast door set in the eastern wall -- a disc of dull
metal, seamless but for a keyhole, standing today a hand's width ajar on its
dead hinges.  Through the gap comes a sound like a held breath that is never let
out.  To the north a passage circles away, the long way round; the gallery lies
south.
~
