#31201
NAME   A Mirror of the Laboratory~
DESCR
The same laboratory again, reflected and reversed, and here the loop has been
allowed to rot.  The bench is on the wrong side, the fallen lamp lies where no
lamp fell, and the catastrophe at the centre plays out with no one in it to
suffer -- an empty space that dies, over and over, where Corin should be.
Something tall and out of time keeps watch over the emptiness.  The true
laboratory lies south; a passage leads east, back toward the way out.
~
