#31202
NAME   The Vault of the Unending Moment~
DESCR
Beyond the mirror-door the loop finally, mercifully stops.  This is a small
vaulted cell of still, dead air, and after the endless repetition outside its
silence rings like a struck bell.  On a low plinth at its centre, cradled in a
setting of silver wire, rests the thing Midian made here at the height of his
madness -- a single moment sealed so that it can never end.  The only way out is
north, back through the ending in the door.
~
