A curved egress passage skirting the edge of the loop, where the repetition
thins to a faint shudder underfoot.  Set in the eastern wall is a plain iron
door, unsealed, that opens onto the long circling passage back toward the
gallery.  The mirrored laboratory lies west; the door out is east.
