#31204
NAME   The Long Way Back~
DESCR
A bare circling passage that carries you the long way round the outside of the
chamber, away from the loop and its grief.  The shudder of repetition falls
behind you with every step, until the air is merely cold, and merely still.  A
plain iron door lies west, back into the chamber's edge; south the passage
returns you to the sealed threshold and the gallery beyond.
