#31217
NAME   The Dissolving Antechamber~
DESCR
You cross into the experiment chamber, and the world grows thin.  This first
room is more absence than substance -- the floor holds underfoot but you cannot
say what it is made of, and the walls are only a suggestion of walls, receding
into grey wherever you look at them straight.  This is where Midian worked to
remove himself from time, and the work has spread: the room is being erased
along with its maker.  The way back south is sealed behind you; the chamber
goes on east.
~
