#31218
NAME   The Prediction Floor~
DESCR
The floor of this wide room is one great lens of glass, and beneath it, dim and
slow, futures still turn.  You can see them moving down there like fish under
ice -- a table, a chair, a door swinging shut on an empty room -- the outcome
he chose, rehearsed again and again beneath your feet.  The air is bitterly
cold and thin, and the ceiling has frayed away entirely, opening on a grey that
is neither sky nor dark.  The chamber runs east and west.
~
