#31220
NAME   The Unmaking Threshold~
DESCR
The chamber's eastern edge, where it gives out entirely.  Beyond this point
there is no room at all, only the grey, and the threshold itself is going --
you can feel it thinning under you even as you stand.  A stair of vanishing
stone folds back south toward the gallery, the only way that still holds.
Whatever Midian meant to become, he meant to become it here, at the exact place
where the world runs out.
~
